  "markdown": "# Content model catalogue\n\nNamespace: headlessco.content-model-master\nCMMF version: 1.2.0\n\n## Relationships\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n  m0[\"article (entry)\"]\n  m1[\"page (entry)\"]\n  m2[\"person (entry)\"]\n  m3[\"seo-metadata (object)\"]\n  m0 -->|\"body / richTextEmbed / repeatable\"| m2\n  m0 -->|\"author / reference / singular / linked\"| m2\n  m0 -.->|\"seo / object / singular\"| m3\n  m1 -.->|\"seo / object / singular\"| m3\n  m1 -->|\"related_articles / reference / repeatable / linked\"| m0\n```\n\n## Article (article)\n\nKind: entry\n\nEditorial article content type.\n\n| Field | Type | Required | Localised | Repeatable | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| title | string | true | false | false |  |\n| slug | slug | true | false | false |  |\n| summary | text | false | false | false |  |\n| body | richText | true | false | false |  |\n| hero_image | asset | false | false | false |  |\n| author | reference | false | false | false |  |\n| seo | object | false | false | false |  |\n\neditorial:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"labelField\": \"title\",\n  \"preview\": {\n    \"title\": \"title\",\n    \"description\": \"summary\",\n    \"image\": \"hero_image\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\ngovernance:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"owner\": \"platform-team\",\n  \"status\": \"active\",\n  \"maturity\": \"stable\"\n}\n```\n\n## Page (page)\n\nKind: entry\n\nGeneric page model for composed website content.\n\n| Field | Type | Required | Localised | Repeatable | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| title | string | true | false | false |  |\n| slug | slug | true | false | false |  |\n| page_type | enum | false | false | false |  |\n| hero_image | asset | false | false | false |  |\n| seo | object | false | false | false |  |\n| related_articles | reference | false | false | true |  |\n\neditorial:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"labelField\": \"title\",\n  \"preview\": {\n    \"title\": \"title\",\n    \"image\": \"hero_image\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\ngovernance:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"owner\": \"platform-team\",\n  \"status\": \"active\",\n  \"maturity\": \"stable\"\n}\n```\n\n## Person (person)\n\nKind: entry\n\nPerson profile content used for authorship and attribution.\n\n| Field | Type | Required | Localised | Repeatable | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| full_name | string | true | false | false |  |\n| slug | slug | true | false | false |  |\n| bio | text | false | false | false |  |\n| headshot | asset | false | false | false |  |\n\neditorial:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"labelField\": \"full_name\",\n  \"preview\": {\n    \"title\": \"full_name\",\n    \"description\": \"bio\",\n    \"image\": \"headshot\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\ngovernance:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"owner\": \"platform-team\",\n  \"status\": \"active\",\n  \"maturity\": \"stable\"\n}\n```\n\n## SEO Metadata (seo-metadata)\n\nKind: object\n\nReusable embedded SEO metadata structure.\n\n| Field | Type | Required | Localised | Repeatable | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| meta_title | string | false | false | false |  |\n| meta_description | text | false | false | false |  |\n| canonical_url | string | false | false | false |  |\n| noindex | boolean | false | false | false |  |\n\neditorial:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"labelField\": \"meta_title\"\n}\n```\n\n"
}
